  "design_note": "SLUDGESKI Ice/Poison: lopsided shaggy snowbank creature, heavy soft icy brow and TWO real black pupils exposed on LIGHTicyface, ONE asymmetric black-ice HORN at upperLEFTcrown. Exactly2drooping thick slushARMS,2longflat SKI-SHAPEDgrownFEET withuprighttoeends; noheldskis/clothes. Big broad shoulders slump downinto short rounded darkslushbelly,2largecrystalteeth simplifiedtolightink1. Darkpurpleink2 poolsinsidebelly/undersidearms, icyblueink1 mainbody. Head notseparateanimalears. SOUTH bothupturnedskitoes, WEST longnearfoottoeLEFT/farfootalternates, NORTH blank heavysnowback/horn2arms2skifeet, NOeye/mouthorfaceonback. Gait ski-feet slidealternately, droopingarmscounter-swingonepixel, head/eyesstayfixed. Maxnative14x14."
